**Summary of this run:**

**Report findings (3 prioritised improvements):**

| # | Improvement | Estimated savings |
|---|---|---|
| 1 ✅ | **Anthropic prompt caching in FatBaby emily-agent** — system prompt (~2 000T) + 24 tool defs (~2 400T) cached with `cache_control: ephemeral` | ~35 600T/tick (81% reduction on that prefix); ~$1.28/hr at 12 ticks/hr |
| 2 | **RSI artifact compression** (`rsi.go` `buildGenerationPrompt`) — full prior-iteration artifacts grow quadratically; replace with `analysis`+`next_focus` summaries | ~15 000T/task on multi-iteration RSI runs |
| 3 | **Observation-watcher batch-window default** — amortises the 600-word `runReportFooter` overhead across N observations instead of paying it N times | ~70% overhead reduction on busy days with 10+ observations/hr |

