Done. Here's the summary of this 50-observation batch:

**Two code fixes made (commit `371d957`):**

1. **`internal/entitygraph/observer.go` + `cmd/entity-graph/main.go`** — Fixed the dominant false-alarm: `detectGaps()` was checking `len(graph.Nodes) > 0` (total accumulated graph across all history) for the "0 proposals despite directors found" gap. This caused every batch of non-proxy 8-Ks (earnings, officer appointments, M&A) to trigger `needs_attention` after the first successful run. Fix: `BuildObservation` now takes `directorsThisBatch` (director votes found in this batch only), and the gap fires only when the current batch actually contained proxy filings with director data.

2. **`internal/newssite/templates.go`** — Fixed ticker search: the `input`/`change` event listeners called `navigate()` on every keystroke, redirecting users mid-typing. Fix: build a JS `Set` from the datalist options; `maybeNavigate()` only auto-navigates when the typed value exactly matches a known ticker symbol.

